@startuml
title Activity Diagram: Dashboard Data Aggregation Workflow

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12

start
:User opens dashboard;
:Backend receives dashboard request;
:Check Redis for cached summary;

if (Cached dashboard summary available?) then (Yes)
  :Return cached dashboard indicators;
else (No)
  :Retrieve profile, workouts,\nmeal logs, body records, and goals;
  :Aggregate workout frequency\nand training volume;
  :Aggregate calorie intake,\nmacro ratio, and nutrition gaps;
  :Calculate BMR, TDEE,\nand calorie balance;
  :Calculate body weight moving average\nand progress trend;
  :Calculate goal adherence\nand milestone status;
  :Compare current week/month\nagainst previous period;
  :Store dashboard summary in Redis;
endif

:Render dashboard cards and charts;
:Display key insights to user;
stop
@enduml
